spell's yearly precipitation has risen <strong class='sig'>+0.21 inches per decade</strong> (95% range +0.05 to +0.37), about +2.6 inches since 1900. The 1991\u20132020 normal is 16.7 inches a year. The wettest year was 1996 (25.23 in); the driest, 1929 (10.39 in).","show_snow":true,"sig_bars":{"lo":false,"hi":false},"t_year":"2026 so far: 4 daily record highs, 1 daily record low"}}